OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident stood down at
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident at a Kent hospital
OL,7,Fhas been stood down after it warned of
OL,8,F"extremely long" waits and
OL,9,Funprecedented pressure on services.
OL,11,FOn Monday, East Kent Hospitals NHS
OL,12,Ftrust warned people going to the
OL,13,FWilliam Harvey Hospital to only visit
OL,14,Fits A&E department with "a
OL,15,Flife-threatening illness or injury", or
OL,16,Fif they were "collecting someone being
OL,17,Fdischarged".
OL,19,FBeds across its hospitals were full, it
OL,20,Fsaid, adding its capacity to admit more
OL,21,Fpatients was limited.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
