OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident stood down at
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, despite downgrading the
OL,7,Fsituation on Wednesday, a trust
OL,8,Fspokesperson said the hospital was
OL,9,F"still extremely busy, with the
OL,10,Femergency department still under a lot
OL,11,Fof pressure".
